    or \"Shien\" Effect Monster; that target gains 500 ATK until the end of this
    turn.\r\n\u25CF 4 Counters: Add 1 \"Six Samurai\" monster from your Deck or GY
    to your hand.\r\n\u25CF 6 Counters: Target 1 \"Shien\" Effect Monster in your
    GY; Special Summon that target."
